<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1492688176"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:59.705"><div begin="46.802" end="1:02.406" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.802" end="49.904" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.802" end="48.448">形同虚设</span><span begin="48.448" end="49.294">的时</span><span begin="49.294" end="49.904">间</span></p><p begin="50.511" end="53.999" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.511" end="51.059">在你</span><span begin="51.059" end="51.501">眼</span><span begin="51.501" end="52.053">里</span><span begin="52.210" end="53.076">成为了</span><span begin="53.076" end="53.999">无限</span></p><p begin="54.299" end="57.490" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.299" end="55.894">青春充满</span><span begin="55.894" end="56.692">了不</span><span begin="56.692" end="57.490">眠</span></p><p begin="57.846" end="1:02.406" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.846" end="58.690">是为了</span><span begin="58.690" end="59.490">追寻</span><span begin="59.624" end="1:00.480">更多的</span><span begin="1:00.635" end="1:01.018">明</span><span begin="1:01.018" end="1:02.406">天</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.810" end="1:33.052" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:16.810" end="1:19.938" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.810" end="1:18.462">好似无尽</span><span begin="1:18.462" end="1:18.830">的</span><span begin="1:18.830" end="1:19.214">灯</span><span begin="1:19.214" end="1:19.938">街</span></p><p begin="1:20.354" end="1:24.147" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.354" end="1:21.193">从不分</span><span begin="1:21.193" end="1:22.014">你我</span><span begin="1:22.207" end="1:23.006">照亮在</span><span begin="1:23.006" end="1:23.471">心</span><span begin="1:23.471" end="1:24.147">间</span></p><p begin="1:24.302" end="1:27.394" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.302" end="1:25.945">夜已成载</span><span begin="1:25.945" end="1:27.394">心无眠</span></p><p begin="1:27.782" end="1:33.052" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.782" en